{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CdtrLNZ1UVE5GxqxatLCY2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Firecrawl pricing Hobby plan credits per month\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"www.firecrawl.dev\",\"url\":\"https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing.md\"},{\"title\":\"Firecrawl pricing: plans, real costs, and what to watch out for in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.eesel.ai/blog/firecrawl-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"firecrawl pricing\",\"url\":\"https://scrapegraphai.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Table of contents\",\"url\":\"https://webscraping.ai/faq/firecrawl/what-is-the-firecrawl-pricing-structure-and-how-much-does-the-api-cost\"},{\"title\":\"# Firecrawl Pricing 2026: Plans, Credits and Real Costs\",\"url\":\"https://www.activepieces.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing-2026-plans-credits-and-real-costs.md\"},{\"title\":\"docs.firecrawl.dev\",\"url\":\"https://docs.firecrawl.dev/billing\"},{\"title\":\"What looks wrong?\",\"url\":\"https://www.activepieces.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing-2026-plans-credits-and-real-costs\"},{\"title\":\"toolradar.com\",\"url\":\"https://toolradar.com/tools/firecrawl/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Quick Answer\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/web-scraping/firecrawl/\"}]\n\nThe official Firecrawl pricing page lists the Hobby plan at **5,000 credits per month**, but third-party sources report older figures, so the number may have changed.\n\n- **Official pricing page:** The Hobby plan offers 5,000 credits per month at $19/month, or $16/month billed annually. It also has an auto-recharge pack of 1,500 credits for $9.\n- **Firecrawl billing docs:** These describe Hobby tiers at other sizes, such as Hobby 6.5k ($28/month or $290/year) and Hobby 8k ($37/month or $390/year). This suggests the Hobby allowance has been adjustable, so the current pricing page should be checked.\n- **Third-party sites:** Several list older numbers. One reports 3,000 credits / month at $16/month, and another lists a Hobby plan with 20,000 credits per month at $20/month. Both appear outdated or unreliable, since they disagree with the official page.\n\nThe official pricing page is the most authoritative source here.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba159472-bb59-49d0-aa9d-02e0255fcbde","uuid":"43f39bd9-8c2e-432a-beea-775132e8f787","timestamp":"2026-10-16T23:47:04.588Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Firecrawl pricing Hobby plan credits per month","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Y6tXPHw9jbWJYauqbVdUw2","content":[{"title":"www.firecrawl.dev","url":"https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing.md"},{"title":"Firecrawl pricing: plans, real costs, and what to watch out for in 2026","url":"https://www.eesel.ai/blog/firecrawl-pricing"},{"title":"firecrawl pricing","url":"https://scrapegraphai.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing"},{"title":"Table of contents","url":"https://webscraping.ai/faq/firecrawl/what-is-the-firecrawl-pricing-structure-and-how-much-does-the-api-cost"},{"title":"# Firecrawl Pricing 2026: Plans, Credits and Real Costs","url":"https://www.activepieces.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing-2026-plans-credits-and-real-costs.md"},{"title":"docs.firecrawl.dev","url":"https://docs.firecrawl.dev/billing"},{"title":"What looks wrong?","url":"https://www.activepieces.com/blog/firecrawl-pricing-2026-plans-credits-and-real-costs"},{"title":"toolradar.com","url":"https://toolradar.com/tools/firecrawl/pricing"},{"title":"Quick Answer","url":"https://costbench.com/software/web-scraping/firecrawl/"}]},"The official Firecrawl pricing page lists the Hobby plan at **5,000 credits per month**, but third-party sources report older figures, so the number may have changed.\n\n- **Official pricing page:** The Hobby plan offers 5,000 credits per month at $19/month, or $16/month billed annually. It also has an auto-recharge pack of 1,500 credits for $9.\n- **Firecrawl billing docs:** These describe Hobby tiers at other sizes, such as Hobby 6.5k ($28/month or $290/year) and Hobby 8k ($37/month or $390/year). This suggests the Hobby allowance has been adjustable, so the current pricing page should be checked.\n- **Third-party sites:** Several list older numbers. One reports 3,000 credits / month at $16/month, and another lists a Hobby plan with 20,000 credits per month at $20/month. Both appear outdated or unreliable, since they disagree with the official page.\n\nThe official pricing page is the most authoritative source here."],"durationSeconds":4.658841552,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CdtrLNZ1UVE5GxqxatLCY2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
